title: "SlicerDDSurfer: an integrated 3D Slicer workflow for anatomical reconstruction and connectivity analysis from diffusion MRI"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Chengjin
repository-code: "https://github.com/ChengjinLii/SlicerDDSurfer"
url: "https://github.com/ChengjinLii/SlicerDDSurfer"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-24"
abstract: >-
  SlicerDDSurfer is a 3D Slicer scripted module and command-line workflow for
  diffusion MRI-derived anatomical reconstruction, segmentation, parcellation,
  microstructure analysis, tractography, bundle analysis, connectome
  construction, quality-control review, and provenance capture.
